.TH "TRCC\-THEME" "1" "" "trcc\-linux 9.9.5" "TRCC Manual"
.SH NAME
trcc\-theme \- Save / export / import themes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrcc theme\fR \fISUBCOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save / export / import themes.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.SS cloud\-list
.PP
\fBtrcc theme cloud\-list\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
List themes in Thermalright's hosted catalog.
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-category, \-c \fICATEGORY\fR\fR
Category prefix: 'all' / 'a' / 'b' / 'c' / 'd' / 'e' / 'y'
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS cloud\-load
.PP
\fBtrcc theme cloud\-load\fR \fIKEY\fR \fITHEME_ID\fR
.PP
Download a cloud theme and load it on a device.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key, e.g. 0402:3922
.TP
\fBTHEME_ID\fR
Cloud theme id, e.g. a001
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS create
.PP
\fBtrcc theme create\fR \fIKEY\fR \fINAME\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
One\-shot theme builder: bg + optional mask + overlay metrics \-> save. Mirrors legacy trcc theme \-\-save. Dispatches a chain of existing Commands: LoadImage for the background, UploadCustomMask if \-\-mask given, AddOverlayElement per \-\-metric arg, then SaveTheme to persist the result. Stops on the first failure and leaves the device in whatever state was reached.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key, e.g. 0402:3922
.TP
\fBNAME\fR
Theme name to save as
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-bg, \-b \fIBACKGROUND\fR\fR
Background image (PNG/JPG/BMP/WEBP)
.TP
\fB\-\-mask \fIMASK\fR\fR
Optional mask PNG to overlay (custom_<name>/01.png)
.TP
\fB\-\-metric, \-m \fIMETRIC\fR\fR
Overlay metric spec: 'metric_key:x,y[:color[:size]]'  \-  e.g. 'cpu:temp:160,90:#ff8800:24'. color defaults to '#ffffff', size defaults to 16. Repeatable.
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS delete
.PP
\fBtrcc theme delete\fR \fIPATH\fR
.PP
Delete a theme directory. Path\-based to match legacy's delete_theme(lcd, path)  \-  the caller already has the resolved path from theme list output.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBPATH\fR
Absolute path to the theme directory to delete
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS export
.PP
\fBtrcc theme export\fR \fIKEY\fR \fITHEME_NAME\fR \fIARCHIVE_PATH\fR
.PP
Zip a theme into an archive file.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key (e.g. 0402:3922) whose resolution scopes the lookup
.TP
\fBTHEME_NAME\fR
Theme name (directory under user_theme_dir(w, h))
.TP
\fBARCHIVE_PATH\fR
Destination archive path (e.g. theme.tr)
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS export\-config
.PP
\fBtrcc theme export\-config\fR \fIKEY\fR \fIOUTPUT_PATH\fR
.PP
Snapshot one device's settings to a JSON file. Captures everything in DeviceSettings: active theme path, brightness, orientation, overlay edits, mask choice, format prefs. Pair with trcc theme import\-config to restore on another host or after a wipe.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key, e.g. 0402:3922
.TP
\fBOUTPUT_PATH\fR
Destination JSON path (e.g. mydevice.json)
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS export\-dc
.PP
\fBtrcc theme export\-dc\fR \fIKEY\fR \fITHEME_NAME\fR \fIOUTPUT_PATH\fR
.PP
Write a theme out as legacy config1.dc for Windows TRCC users.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key (e.g. 0402:3922)  \-  its resolution scopes the lookup and layers the user's overlay elements into the export
.TP
\fBTHEME_NAME\fR
Theme name (directory under user_theme_dir(w, h))
.TP
\fBOUTPUT_PATH\fR
Where to write the config1.dc file
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS export\-overlay
.PP
\fBtrcc theme export\-overlay\fR \fIKEY\fR \fITHEME_NAME\fR \fIOUTPUT_PATH\fR
.PP
Export just a theme's overlay layout (the metric grid) for sharing  \-  lighter than the whole\-theme zip and distinct from the DC binary.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key (e.g. 0402:3922)  \-  its resolution scopes the lookup
.TP
\fBTHEME_NAME\fR
Theme name (directory under user_theme_dir(w, h))
.TP
\fBOUTPUT_PATH\fR
Where to write the overlay layout file
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS import
.PP
\fBtrcc theme import\fR \fIKEY\fR \fIARCHIVE_PATH\fR [\fINAME\fR]
.PP
Unpack a theme archive into the device's per\-resolution theme dir.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key (e.g. 0402:3922) whose resolution scopes the target
.TP
\fBARCHIVE_PATH\fR
Archive to unpack
.TP
\fBNAME\fR
Theme name (defaults to archive filename stem)
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS import\-config
.PP
\fBtrcc theme import\-config\fR \fIKEY\fR \fIINPUT_PATH\fR
.PP
Restore one device's settings from an export\-config JSON file.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key, e.g. 0402:3922
.TP
\fBINPUT_PATH\fR
Source JSON written by trcc theme export\-config
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS list
.PP
\fBtrcc theme list\fR [\fIKEY\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
List themes for a device resolution. By default scans both data/theme{W}{H} (pkg + GitHub\-downloaded) and user_content_dir/data/theme{W}{H} (legacy user\-saved location) so installed\-user themes show up alongside fresh downloads.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key (e.g. 0402:3922)  \-  its resolution scopes the scan. Required unless \-\-dir is given.
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-dir, \-d \fIDIRECTORY\fR\fR
Override: scan an explicit directory instead of the device's theme dirs.
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SS save
.PP
\fBtrcc theme save\fR \fIKEY\fR \fINAME\fR
.PP
Duplicate the device's active theme directory under a new name.
.PP
Arguments:
.RS 4
.TP
\fBKEY\fR
Device key whose active theme to save
.TP
\fBNAME\fR
New theme name (directory under user_content_dir)
.RE
.PP
Options:
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show this command's help and exit.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtrcc\fR(1)
